{"id":"9a6819cbf817140e","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-tarski-undefinability.md","title":"No Full Truth Definition","display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — No Full Truth Definition","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-tarski-undefinability","aliases":["67-thm-tarski-undefinability"],"display":"thm-tarski-undefinability — No Full Truth Definition","depends_on":["[[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]","[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","[[67-df-sentence]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"Theorem 3","source_printed_pages":17,"source_pdf_pages":28,"source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tarski-undefinability — No Full Truth Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea2f0556099a403a\" href=\"?note=ea2f0556099a403a\" title=\"67-df-partial-truth-definition\">67-df-partial-truth-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"28"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\supseteq Q\">\\(U\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 是一致算术理论，允许其公理集合非递归可枚举；外部一致性写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\nvdash\\bot\">\\(U\\nvdash\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\Gamma}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\Gamma}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ea2f0556099a403a\" href=\"?note=ea2f0556099a403a\" title=\"67-df-partial-truth-definition\">67-df-partial-truth-definition</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\)</span> 为至多自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的公式集合；取自然编号并使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\nvdash\\bot\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\n\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\nvdash\\bot\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\n\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 1.3, p.17。假如 τ 是全真理定义，固定点给出 Q⊢θ↔¬τ(⌜θ⌝)，而真理模式给出 U⊢θ↔τ(⌜θ⌝)，故 U 不一致。这里无有效公理化假设；不能把“没有内部全真理定义”误解成没有外部真句集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-partial-truth-definition","status":"resolved","id":"ea2f0556099a403a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partial-truth-definition","status":"resolved","id":"ea2f0556099a403a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\Gamma}$ 见 [[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}$ 为至多自由变量 $v$ 的公式集合；取自然编号并使用 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\Gamma}$ 见 [[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}$ 为至多自由变量 $v$ 的公式集合；取自然编号并使用 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\supseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"U\\nvdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\Gamma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"U\\nvdash\\bot\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\n\\mathrm{PartialTruth}_{U,\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}}(\\tau).","display":true}],"bytes":1486,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-tarski-undefinability]]"}],"outgoing":["ea2f0556099a403a","f76c99f69499336d","854772391cef4007"]}